<title>AUSTRIA: Austrian Oct jobless steady at 4.1 pct - news agency.</title>
<headline>Austrian Oct jobless steady at 4.1 pct - news agency.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austria's unemployment rate stood at 4.1 percent in October, unchanged from a month earlier, Austrian state news agency APA said.</p>
<p>Nobody at the social affairs ministry, which usually releases the figure, was available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom +431 53112 274</p>
